    <statement><p>Determine whether the lines
    <me>L_1:   \frac{x - 21}{7} = \frac{y-13}{6} = \frac{z - 20}{7}</me>
and 
<me>L_2:   \frac{x - 1}{-21} = \frac{y + 3}{-18} = \frac{z - 2}{-21}</me>
