<p>Do/are the lines (intersect/skew/parallel):<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Point of intersection: (<fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0002"/>, <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0003"/>,<fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0004"/>)</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>parallel</p>
    </answer>
